ck at home 24 hours  later after a night out partying with  friends in London Robbie got a call to  audition for wolf of Wall Street in New  York but when she turned up later that  day wearing jeans and flat boots to meet  the movies casting director Alan Lewis  Lewis sent her away to buy a tight dress  and super high heels when it came to the  audition itself Leonardo DiCaprio's  ad-libs almost threw Robbie off course  until she did  sided to take a risk and responded to  his improvise now get over here and kiss  me line by smacking him right in the  face DiCaprio and director Martin  Scorsese had a good laugh about it and  that dramatic performance sealed the  role for her actually Robbie seems to be  getting a bit of a rep for beating up  her co-stars in the war comedy-drama  whiskey-tango-foxtrot there's a scene  where Robbie's character playfully  punches Tina Fey and says were going out  tonight  according to Fey Robbie was so strong  from all the physical training she was  doing the Suicide Squad that her  on-camera punch left a huge bruise on  faze arm which lasted for several days  and then there's a sex scene that Robbie  filmed with Alexander Skarsgard for The  Legend of Tarzan which according to  skarsgård who plays Tarzan was the only  time he got injured during the whole  shoot apparently director David Yates  wanted the scene to have an animalistic  quality so is encouraging Robbie to beat  skarsgård up going back to wolf of wall  street martin scorsese gave Robbie the  option of wearing a robe or underwear  for that scene where she seduces  Leonardo DiCaprio's character wearing  nothing but stockings and high heels but  Robbie refused saying that her character  Naomi would be completely naked as her  body was her only form of currency in  that world still Robbie was in need of  some Dutch courage to film those sex  scenes so knocked back several shots of  tequila before hitting the set oh and by  the way many of those clingy outfits  that Robbie wore